description":"Ward's Pond lies north of Jamaica Pond along the Emerald Necklace route toward Olmsted Park. Reaching it requires leaving the immediate pond loop and crossing or following connecting paths, with wet and uneven conditions possible.","latitude":42.3220129,"longitude":-71.1180559,"source_label":"Boston Parks and Recreation","source_url":"https://www.boston.gov/parks/jamaica-pond","verified_at":"2026-08-06","details":{"category":"destination","includeInParentGallery":true,"positionQuality":"mapped feature","coordinateSource":"OpenStreetMap way 89786727","informationSourceLabel":"Boston Parks and Recreation","informationSourceUrl":"https://www.boston.gov/parks/jamaica-pond","informationCheckedAt":"2026-08-06","imageUrl":"/assets/parks/boston-super/jamaica-pond/04-jamaica-pond-p1030840a-jpg.webp","imageSourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jamaica_Pond_P1030840a.jpg","imageAuthor":"NewtonCourt","imageLicense":"CC BY-SA 4.0","imageAlt":"Ward's Pond and Emerald Necklace connection at Jamaica Pond"}}]}
